 "what_this_is": "The size-band form as a side run (Size adjustment; R7, adopted by Joe on 2026-11-19, D-107) on the headline set at 2%: each host's cell of reference-year region by size band, its count of comparison utilities in the cell (every unit eligible under the main design's rules, ownership and full-window usability included), the support rule's first limb, the hosts not estimable, and the rank test made before any fit on the regressors alone. Quantities only: load, sales, customers, ownership and the usable flag; no price, revenue, bill or outcome is read and nothing is fitted. The per-host form is the side run's form, adopted by Joe on 2026-11-19 (D-111) for the headline set at 2%, where it was tested to be the same design as the form pooled by cohort and cell with each host's ownership exclusions kept (D-110); applying it to a set in which hosts share a cohort and a cell is outside this freeze, build refuses such a set in words, and no extension is built. A side run on a design on which no validation was made. PROVISIONAL: the design stands as of 2026-11-18 under the ownership code in the file when this was run, and the plan is a DRAFT, not frozen.",
